s of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm portion of fibroadipose tissue which is sectioned to reveal lobulated  well demarcated  rubbery  pink nodule  This specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes M through P  Resident  JAMES J  TIESINGA  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   LEFT BREAST MASS  EXCISION   CELLULAR MIXED TUMOR   PHYLLODES TUMOR  O R  Resident  DARRYL E  PALMER TOY  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Robert Henry Young  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Leslie Wayne Ottinger  M D  PART A  BREAST MASS  LEFT  PART B  2ND BREAST MASS  LEFT    report_end  , no_TubularCancer.
