 quadrant  1 frag  RSS   Micro 4  upper outer quadrant  1 frag  RSS   Micro 5  upper outer quadrant  1 frag  RSS   Micro 6  additional fragments of breast tissue from middle of left breast  with potential cysts  0 5cm     Part two  labeled   2  right breast   consists of a 475 gram simple mastectomy  specimen  19 5cm medial to lateral  17 1cm superior to inferior  2 0cm  superficial to deep  with skin ellipse  17 1 x 6 0cm   with areola  4 0cm in  diameter  and nipple  1 5cm in diameter   A curvilinear scar is present  lateral to the nipple  2 2cm in length   This scar marks the site of two  previous biopsies showing ADH per the surgeon  Deep to the scar  there is a  cyst  0 8cm in greatest dimension   The area of the scar and the fibrous  tissue deep to it are entirely submitted  Representative sections of the  remainder of the breast are also submitted  No lesions are grossly present  within the breast specimen  which consists of 50  fat and 50  fibrous tissue   Micro 7  nipple  5 frags  ESS   Micro REMOVED_DATE  scar and underlying fibrous tissue  multi frags  ESS   Micro REMOVED_DATE  additional fibrous tissue near previous biopsy site  2 frags   RSS   Micro REMOVED_DATE  additional fibrous tissue adjacent to biopsy site  2 frags  RSS   Micro 15  upper outer quadrant  1 frag  RSS   Micro 16  lower outer quadrant  1 frag  RSS   Micro 17  upper inner quadrant  1 frag  RSS   Micro 18  lower inner quadrant  1 frag  RSS   dl  Reports to  RHEI  ESTHER M D   SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST MASTECTOMY   PARTIAL OR SIMPLE  ADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST MASTECTOMY   PARTIAL OR SIMPLE   report_end  , no_TubularCancer.
