s 1cm away from the first one and is adjacent to the  posterior margin  1cm from the medial margin  and 2cm from the superior  margin  This area measures 0 3cm in diameter  The remainder of the tissue  consists of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is entirely  submitted for histologic analysis from superior to inferior   Micro REMOVED_DATE  entire specimen submitted from superior to inferior margins  The  areas of firmness are contained in cassettes REMOVED_DATE  mir  Reports to  IGLEHART  JAMES  DIRK M D   SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST   EXCISIONAL TISSUE W MARGINS   report_end  , no_TubularCancer.
