pse in the 12 o clock position  the short stitch in the 6 o clock position  and the long stitch in the 9 o clock position  short stitch indicating deep margin and long stitch lateral   The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a 2 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm area of fibrosis with cysts ranging in size from 0 1cm to 0 2cm in greatest dimension  This fibrotic area is present 0 2cm from the anterior resection margin  0 1cm from the lateral resection margin  1 8cm from the deep resection margin  0 4cm from the inferior resection margin  and 0 8cm from the medial resection margin  Representative sections are submitted as follows  F  Lesion and anterior resection margin  G  Lesion and lateral resection margin  H  Lesion and medial resection margin  I  Representative section of lesion  ink is anterolateral   J  Representative section of overlying skin ellipse  Labeled  additional deep margin Phylloid s  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue  inked and sectioned to reveal unremarkable fatty parenchyma  submitted entirely in K through M  Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  LEFT BREAST MAMMOGRAPHIC LESION  DISCRETE NODULE  AWAIT PERMANENTS  O R  Resident  STEPHEN LAU  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Judith Ann Ferry  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  LEFT   REEXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT   ADDITIONAL DEEP MARGIN   report_end  , no_TubularCancer.
