ells   Positive  3   Moderate to strong complete membrane immunoreactivity in   30  of tumor cells   Cytoplasmic immunoreactivity alone is scored as a negative result   External controls are evaluated and show appropriate Immunoreactivity   Some of the reagents used in these assays may be approved for investigational  use only   Addendum  1 by Jane E  Brock M B   B S   Ph D   Electronically signed on  Wednesday February 11   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 05 20 58PM   report_end  , no_TubularCancer.
